# Hotel Review Site

Welcome to the **Hotel Review Site**, a simple web-based project that showcases different hotels in Kenya with categories like beachfront, city, and safari locations. Users can explore individual hotel pages featuring image sliders, descriptions, and booking information.

## 🌐 Live Preview

>https://github.com/janicekariuki/hotel-reviews-site

## 📁 Project Structure

## 🚀 Features

- Responsive HTML layout
- Animated image sliders
- Separate pages for each hotel
- Modern styling using custom CSS
- Simple, clean user navigation
